Everything structural has not changed. Annie re-entered after a drug request. She retracted a confession. She deployed warmth on the days the relationship appeared most at risk. She answered 'how was work' but did not come back that evening. Dan opened the door after his most explicit goodbye. He provided drugs the day he received confirmation of infidelity. He asked her to come over more times than she came. The 2.12:1 message ratio confirms that the fundamental asymmetry — who is doing the work of maintaining the connection — is worse, not better.

